@page "/"

<PageTitle>Notification API</PageTitle>

<h1>Notification API</h1>
<p>
  Home Assistant sends notifications to <a href="contacts">contacts</a> and <a href="groups">groups</a> by handle
  (<code>contact:alice</code>, <code>group:family</code>). This add-on keeps the phone numbers and decides which
  channels to use for each priority.
</p>
<p>Set up the Home Assistant side on the <a href="integration">Integration</a> page. Every change is recorded in the <a href="audit">audit log</a>.</p>
